{"summary":"Hack and slash through a retro computer system in this turn-based roguelite.","description":"A tactical RPG fusing roguelikes, turn-based tactics and hack and slash games – made by a solo developer with a penchant for minimalist designs.\n\n- Fight through bite-sized tactical puzzles\n- Create powerful builds from a plethora of items which grant you skills and can change gameplay mechanics\n- Carry on your favorite items between runs in normal mode\n- Start from scratch each week and compete with other players in the online ladder mode\n- Try various playstyles and hunt for challenging achievements\n- Enjoy a lovingly crafted story of ridiculous computer nostalgia and a blast of a retro soundtrack","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hRDuwvwoQnU?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Dv1_uIX5jdBHcRL8fWwSvJtK4BSos7KK0PQhjyn0dnbiqcvJU4TVMLgi7r9-CVWt44rveNDLuFYMqcH2kWTU","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VMgrMNM_wzKCKD6onu1VQGXpIlu9Kt5gI6Sa929ZaeQz5Kt0mzlWW-6Ten7NHKIeLS0JNKnTedlKSuHF-ok-VOI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l-f4eVGcw5JqQcoe7Cl1EWlfoP6vblueul0GgMHTx0kXCfmlEA0yjdOoAkwqEgLnq5EC1Qs4iTEDhPWWEyKQVg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OlRWXL2Rq0GuVSeyX_7fMUziM2RnymUSyyltIPzMfyFGWlkFEre2OVZg9AelZupTUrQh9oY2ivhYBiKrCfKMpYM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/T432GofdRD5dittLzZr5VgRAlYtPv9vgEzknusOsj_00VbpwS0ChWUMUsNT7e8VkzB91M10cDQNcAEhnl8wOCUE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0ksCFSTqgStm_3_FmT_dc2Mf5ZF4arata4O9Fu4ToeoSPOKQ0zFnl4v-0vp-_BepTkunV8uAMX7T4ImQfQV6TG8","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6yXIJkdSO6uHxrTi1i2wQloEt9EcFgZUo8kKMWtGSaSSkouum6J1UzADDp204WilQgwsUrp7m3o9BBvtvusHYrE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VMgrMNM_wzKCKD6onu1VQGXpIlu9Kt5gI6Sa929ZaeQz5Kt0mzlWW-6Ten7NHKIeLS0JNKnTedlKSuHF-ok-VOI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l-f4eVGcw5JqQcoe7Cl1EWlfoP6vblueul0GgMHTx0kXCfmlEA0yjdOoA